OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits killing woman who died
OL,4,Ain house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted killing a woman who
OL,7,Fdied in an alleged arson attack on a
OL,8,Fresidential building in which eight
OL,9,Fother people were injured.
OL,11,FPawel Kulpa, 34, is accused of murder
OL,12,Ffollowing the death of Anna Kowalska,
OL,13,F50, in a fire in Hounslow, west London,
OL,14,Fon 19 August.
OL,16,FHe pleaded guilty to the manslaughter
OL,17,Fof Kowalska at the Old Bailey, which
OL,18,Fwas not accepted by the prosecution.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
