OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits killing woman who died
OL,4,Ain house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FKulpa and co-accused Slawomir Alama,
OL,7,F41, denied murder and eight counts of
OL,8,Fattempted murder relating to other
OL,9,Foccupants. The pair also pleaded not
OL,10,Fguilty to arson with intent to endanger
OL,11,Flife and an alternative offence of
OL,12,Farson being reckless as to whether life
OL,13,Fcould be endangered.
